different prices.</li>\n<li>To build confidence speaking to other adults.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>Don't worry if your child needs lots of help the first time they do this.</p>\n<p>The focus is on the experience rather than the maths.</p>\n<p>There is no need for your child to add up or calculate change themselves.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "6hF5MaYrvYwV28bunwlSy", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 327, "name": "Where's the learning?", "logCreatedAt": "2024-06-26T10:32:29.072723", "logUpdatedAt": "2024-06-26T10:37:12.787778", "logCreatedById": 108180408, "logUpdatedById": 108180408, "nameForContentDev": "Financial Literacy - real shop - EY/Y1"}}, "order": 3, "btnType": "SECONDARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 359650993, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 327, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "NrMnvH4_Ucbg02XpGDYv8", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 359651017, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 359650993, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>What to do:</h2>\n<p>Help your child to pay for something with coins in a shop.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose something to buy</li>\n<li>Talk about how much it costs.</li>\n<li>Look at the coins together and choose the ones you need.</li>\n<li>Give your child the coins and the thing you are buying to take to the till</li>\n<li>Let them do the buying and take any change and the receipt.</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "JsKfYp0asaMfM8JHyinrc", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]